# Git ignores for the charts/ directory tree (patterns are relative to this
# file's directory).
#
# Each chart carries a `charts/*.tgz` subdir (vendored dep tarballs generated
# by `helm dependency update`, run via `make deps`) and a `Chart.lock`
# (generated lockfile of dep versions). Both regenerate on every dep change
# and bloat PR diffs without adding value to the chart's source.

# Vendored dep tarballs (per chart)
*/charts/
*/*.tgz

# Generated dep lockfiles
*/Chart.lock
